- `apps/macos/` — native SwiftUI macOS app. `project.yml` (XcodeGen) is the source of truth — the `.xcodeproj` is generated and gitignored; run `xcodegen generate` after editing it. Bundle id `{{BUNDLE_PREFIX}}.mac`, plist in `Signing/Info-App.plist`, Developer ID signing is Manual with `DEVELOPMENT_TEAM` injected from the environment — never commit a real Team ID (see `apps/macos/scripts/` for build → sign → notarize → dmg).
